<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Farringdon Bakery | Glen Innes</title>
<style>
:root {
  --green: #183c2e;
  --cream: #f8f4e9;
  --paper: #fffdf7;
  --orange: #d77a43;
  --ink: #242b24;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
img { width: 100%; display: block; object-fit: cover; }
.topbar {
  background: var(--green);
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 10px;
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}
header {
  background: var(--paper);
  padding: 20px 7%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
}
.logo {
  color: var(--green);
  font: bold 25px Georgia, serif;
  text-decoration: none;
}
nav { display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: center; }
nav a { text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; }
.button {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--orange);
  color: white;
  padding: 12px 20px;
  text-decoration: none;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-weight: bold;
}
.hero {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  background: var(--green);
  color: white;
  min-height: 500px;
}
.hero-copy {
  padding: 70px 12%;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: flex-start;
}
.eyebrow {
  color: #e5a16d;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: bold;
}
h1, h2, h3 { font-family: Georgia, serif; }
h1 { font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 68px); line-height: 1.05; font-weight: normal; }
.hero p { color: #e4e7dc; }
.hero-image img { height: 100%; min-height: 350px; }
.strip {
  background: #eae3d3;
  color: var(--green);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 30px;
  padding: 18px;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
section { padding: 70px 8%; }
.section-head { text-align: center; max-width: 650px; margin: auto auto 35px; }
.section-head h2, .story h2, .visit h2 {
  color: var(--green);
  font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 46px);
  font-weight: normal;
  line-height: 1.15;
}
.menu-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 22px;
}
.menu-card {
  background: var(--paper);
  border: 1px solid #e9e1d2;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 5px;
}
.menu-card img { height: 220px; }
.menu-info { padding: 20px; }
.menu-info h3 { color: var(--green); margin-top: 0; }
.menu-info p { color: #716f64; font-size: 14px; }
.story {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  background: #eae3d3;
  padding: 0;
}
.story img { height: 100%; min-height: 400px; }
.story-copy { padding: 55px 12%; }
.story-copy p { color: #55594e; }
.visit { background: var(--paper); }
.visit-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 40px;
}
.map-card {
  background: var(--cream);
  padding: 30px;
  border: 1px solid #e7dfd0;
}
.cta {
  text-align: center;
  background: var(--green);
  color: white;
}
.cta h2 { font: normal clamp(32px, 4vw, 46px) Georgia, serif; }
.cta p { color: #e4e7dc; }
footer {
  background: #102a20;
  color: white;
  padding: 30px 7%;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
footer a { color: white; }
@media(max-width:760px) {
  header { padding: 16px 5%; }
  nav { gap: 10px; }
  nav a:not(.nav-cta) { display: none; }
  .hero, .story, .visit-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .hero-copy { padding: 45px 7%; }
  .hero-image img { height: 300px; min-height: 0; }
  section { padding: 55px 6%; }
  .menu-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .story img { min-height: 280px; }
  .story-copy { padding: 40px 7%; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">YOUR LOCAL BAKERY IN GLEN INNES, AUCKLAND</div>

<header>
  <a href="#" class="logo">Farringdon Bakery</a>
  <nav>
    <a href="#menu">Our menu</a>
    <a href="#story">About us</a>
    <a href="#visit">Find us</a>
    <a class="button nav-cta" href="#visit">Visit us ↗</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">A little local goodness</div>
      <h1>Good pies.<br>Good people.<br>Good days.</h1>
      <p>Make a stop at your local Glen Innes bakery. Pick up something savoury, treat yourself to something sweet, and take a little deliciousness into your day.</p>
      <a class="button" href="#menu">Explore our favourites ↓</a>
      <p><a style="color:white" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Farringdon+Bakery+Glen+Innes+Auckland">Get directions ↗</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-image">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1623334044303-241021148842?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85" alt="Golden baked pastries">
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="strip">
    <span>Glen Innes local</span>
    <span>Bakery favourites</span>
    <span>A tasty everyday stop</span>
  </div>

  <section id="menu">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow">Something delicious</div>
      <h2>Find your new favourite.</h2>
      <p>Whether you're after a savoury bite or a sweet treat, there's always something delicious to look forward to.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="menu-grid">
      <article class="menu-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621743478914-cc8a86d7e7b5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=85" alt="Golden baked pie">
        <div class="menu-info">
          <h3>Savoury favourites</h3>
          <p>A satisfying savoury bite for lunch or whenever hunger calls.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="menu-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509440159596-0249088772ff?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=85" alt="Freshly baked bread">
        <div class="menu-info">
          <h3>Freshly baked</h3>
          <p>Make your bakery stop part of the day with something delicious.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="menu-card">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509365465985-25d11c17e812?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=85" alt="Sweet bakery treats">
        <div class="menu-info">
          <h3>Sweet treats</h3>
          <p>Treat yourself to a sweet moment on your next visit.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story" id="story">
    <div>
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555507036-ab1f4038808a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=85" alt="Bakery pastries">
    </div>
    <div class="story-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">Your neighbourhood bakery</div>
      <h2>A local stop for something delicious.</h2>
      <p>Some days call for a quick bite, some call for a sweet treat. A bakery stop is a simple way to make the day a little better.</p>
      <p>Find Farringdon Bakery in Glen Innes, Auckland, and pop in on your next trip through the neighbourhood.</p>
      <a class="button" href="#visit">Plan your visit ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="visit" id="visit">
    <div class="visit-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Come on by</div>
        <h2>Find us in Glen Innes.</h2>
        <p>Planning a bakery stop? Use the map link for directions and check the latest listing for today's opening hours.</p>
        <p><strong>Location</strong><br>Glen Innes, Auckland, New Zealand</p>
        <p><strong>Opening hours</strong><br>Check the latest business listing before you visit.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="map-card">
        <div style="font-size:40px">📍</div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Get directions</div>
        <h3>Farringdon Bakery</h3>
        <p>Glen Innes<br>Auckland, New Zealand</p>
        <a class="button" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Farringdon+Bakery+Glen+Innes+Auckland" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Google Maps ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta">
    <div class="eyebrow">Your next bakery run</div>
    <h2>Make today a little tastier.</h2>
    <p>Passing through Glen Innes? Find your route and plan a bakery stop.</p>
    <a class="button" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Farringdon+Bakery+Glen+Innes+Auckland">Get directions ↗</a>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <div><strong>Farringdon Bakery</strong><br>Glen Innes · Auckland, New Zealand</div>
  <div><a href="#menu">Menu</a> · <a href="#story">About</a> · <a href="#visit">Find us</a></div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
